            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420101",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "The Vourukasha Oasis is nice, but Barsom is good too..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444202",
            "initDialog": "644420201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "About Barsom..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420202",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "It's a peaceful place, well-suited for getting some good sleep."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420203",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "...Pari sleep differently from humans."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420204",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "Sleep helps you... Hmm... focus your senses on what the roots and branches say."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444203",
            "initDialog": "644420301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "About the Kory Drums..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420302",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "A human instrument. One that's extremely noisy."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444204",
            "initDialog": "644420401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I won't bother you anymore."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420402",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "*snore*"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444205",
            "initDialog": "644420501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420501",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "*snore*... *snore*... *snore*? Hmm? Ah, you're the ones who are with Sorush..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444206",
            "initDialog": "644420601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420601",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Were you sleeping?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420602",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "Sleep is also a duty..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420603",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "The Vourukasha Oasis is a wonderful place. It has been some time since I was here, but all still seems familiar."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444207",
            "initDialog": "644420701",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420701",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "About Sorush..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420702",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "To wake me only for something so important... I have already forgiven her."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420703",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "The credit for extinguishing the Sign of Apaosha belongs to Sorush... along with all those that helped her."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420704",
                    "speaker": "Rashnu",
                    "text": "Though the situation might not be as she expected, I think the present circumstances are better."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6444208",
            "initDialog": "644420801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "644420801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I won't bother you anymore."
                },
                {
                    "id": "644420802",
